  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
  },
